FEP examples for                                              wlj August 2007
PidToPaz: pyridine to pyrazine (look at this first)
PidToPim: pyridine to pyrimidine                      
PimToTaz: pyrimidine to 1,3,5-triazine                     
BenToPid: benzene to pyridine
BenToPaz: benzene to pyrazine 
BenToTaz: benzene to 1,3,5-triazine

All use OPLS/CM1A with 1.14*CM1A charges, 
10 windows with delta lambda =0.05;
4M/2M/10M for aqueous, 500 TIP4P waters, 
T= 25 C, P = 1 atm.

